  <NAME>peat metagenome</NAME>
  <TITLE>Schlöppnerbrunnen omics: SIP pool and native soil metagenomes</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>The Schlöppnerbrunnen fens are a long studied model system for peatland/wetland research. This BioProject includes data from a combined analysis of DNA pooled from heavy SIP fractions and native peat soil.</DESCRIPTION>
